Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.39,0:00:11.96,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Under the blue sky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:21.62,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Outside in the feathery grass by the river
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.27,0:00:27.23,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play hide-and-seek
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:32.05,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,A patch of sunflowers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.05,0:00:41.99,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's blow, blow round bubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chase the white, white clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.82,0:02:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFFFFFF&}space\Nspace
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too goddamn hot for anyone to be that enthusiastic in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:34.49,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Run, run! Run, run! Along with our friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that song, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.99,0:02:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I learned it from the kids at the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a fun song, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.86,0:02:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On top of the mountain{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I was gonna fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing up this early on a Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm airing out my mattress!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.85,0:03:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's great weather for it, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man. Can't you take anything easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Meanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.01,0:03:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Am I okay!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you! I'm supposed to be a stuffed animal out here! Quit doing this kind of thing to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:44.13,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.34,0:03:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose must be seeing Fujimoto off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:03:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:03:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was just in the next room. And now he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.87,0:04:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's always so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe there's two Fujimotos!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! That's like something out of a suspense drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you have today off?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.95,0:04:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The weather's so nice that I thought I'd air out the mattresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato. Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To fill that bottle with candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, if you get that, don't you think you have better things to do on your Sunday off?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:04:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to help out at Yomogi, even if it's not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's the report.  The previous headmaster of Yomogi Nursery got conned into borrowing a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The previous headmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.  Okiura Sayaka's father.  He died two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The guys who did it are a pretty tough bunch, but one of them has some connections with Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:05:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up? You have today off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I'd air out the mattresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The mattresses?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! The weather's great for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it really is nice out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, let's air them out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose was so happy to have a nice girl like you move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm having a lot of fun living with Chitose, Chiho and Chise, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he being mean to you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:07:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes he is, but sometimes he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.70,0:07:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really get it. What kind of person is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's kinder than he looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.07,0:07:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was that way when he was little, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A little Fujimoto? I can't even imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting. I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, he's so tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this really Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.05,0:07:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.11,0:07:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a picture of the first day he came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.03,0:07:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto came to Yomogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.27,0:07:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto was an orphan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.91,0:07:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Orphan? What's an orphan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A child with no mommy or daddy, no family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't even start if you're not ready to commit to taking care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're just going to take things halfway so you can be self-satisfied,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,you're as bad as the guy who abandoned her to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why he said that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know all about little Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must have been 14 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My father took Fujimoto in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home, Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.72,0:08:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the boy I've been talking about. His name is Fujimoto Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu, this is my daughter Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Sayaka. Nice to meet you, Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know! Let's take a picture to remember this by!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Camera, where's the camera...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.53,0:09:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the gi in Yomogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto lived here from that day on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He looks angry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.35,0:09:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. He always looked like that when he first came.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't open up to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not even you, Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. He was always alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We tried introducing him to the other kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone was interested at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but he never played with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so he just drew further away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't seem to have any friends at school either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto himself seemed like he didn't want to get along with anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so we started to think we couldn't do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotta say "I'm back!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hate you, Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.93,0:10:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye, Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye! See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu, do you like the organ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.73,0:11:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye! See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tasty cold beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're giving them out free!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.11,0:12:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I get one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like a tasty beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're promoting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. It's a new brand. Give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro will be so happy to have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was on a nice summer day like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.81,0:12:47.49,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,My turn next!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.49,0:12:49.57,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.57,0:12:51.60,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,You just went!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop fighting and wait your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will they bloom soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've all worked so hard. I'm sure they'll be beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now let's clean up, and then we can play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.91,0:13:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tomo, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The ball came flying, and Tomo was so surprised she fell over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where does it hurt? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why'd ya shove me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:13:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.09,0:14:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think you'd really fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that! I'm a mess now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's just find the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who missed the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, I can't get it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How'd it get this wet here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just what are you two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, uh, our ball got loose, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's dangerous! You could have hit her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We didn't, so why are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of the garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We all worked so hard taking care of these sunflowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone was so happy that they were about to bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.48,0:14:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's your ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to apologize to the kids before you leave, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You and your big trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then don't go there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The sunflowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, they're just a little hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we hold them up like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.17,0:15:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and water them every day, I'm sure they'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:20.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Chase the white, white, clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.69,0:16:29.99,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Run, run! Along with our friends
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:40.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,On top of the mountain, we can see everything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:50.38,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's look, look for new mysteries!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know how many jobs Fujimoto has, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.91,0:16:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's a pizza boy, and a bike messenger, and he delivers newspapers. A lot of other things too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That many?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's working hard to pay down the nursery's debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For the nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. And... to become a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's up so late every night studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm worried he'll wear himself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so soft and smells so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It smells like sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.95,0:17:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like sunshine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. When you air mattresses out, they smell like sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.47,0:17:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what my father told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow, let's let them all nap in the sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing. It sounds worderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I'm looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:18.24,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, let's take them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.11,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for coming in today. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunshine, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to play the organ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.99,0:18:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Play it! Play it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.55,0:19:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.85,0:19:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, Kiyokazu, play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:23.92,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I see a red, red sunset
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:33.58,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's walk, walk on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:43.09,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's sunny tomorrow, let's come and play
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home, let's go home, my house is right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:19:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, look! You're not getting anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.27,0:20:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I just wanted to air out the mattresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to help out at the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind the mattresses, you're hanging me out to dry here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato? Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.37,0:20:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.83,0:20:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great. I thought I'd give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro has plenty in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.51,0:20:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll go right ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that nice, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.77,0:20:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, wait, I should save it to enjoy right before bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku, you're always so serious about taking care of the trees in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all I can do for Shuichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:21:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just happy I can at least do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.11,0:21:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so happy I can help out at Yomogi, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Being able to help people that are important to you is such a happy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.77,0:21:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Important people?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.59,0:21:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery must be really important to Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Otherwise he wouldn't work so many jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery is really important to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to work hard and help out Miss Sayaka and everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're doing it wrong again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome home, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.83,0:22:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! You were so cute as a little boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you used to get so into playing the organ when you were little,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.74,0:22:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,tapping away with your feet on the pedals?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.99,0:22:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How'd you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.91,0:22:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka showed me a picture today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.20,0:22:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.05,0:22:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see little Kiyokazu too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even Chitose!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For someone who used to be so cute, you sure get angry a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.25,0:22:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit talking about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.14,0:22:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But we wanna hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.39,0:22:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, we'll wait until he's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:01:03.16,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:12.96,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:18.76,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:26.52,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.52,0:01:32.19,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:37.40,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:43.70,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:49.37,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:56.09,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:02:04.81,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... An organ, and boyhood days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:07.82,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:15.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.91,0:23:23.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.92,0:23:31.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:42.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.35,0:23:45.69,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.23,0:23:54.12,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.12,0:24:01.21,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:10.71,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:14.89,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.60,0:24:28.02,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.02,0:24:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(458,388)}... Detective Hanato Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.02,0:24:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(456,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.14,0:22:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
